_🗄️ Data Integrity & Integration_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Don’t overwrite installed translations with a partial refresh snapshot.**

When `$pending > 0` and this run has only some `$entries`, this replaces `sd_ai_lang_packs_installed_translations`; `Admin_Settings::get_installed_ai_translation_entries()` reads that option first, so previously installed translations can disappear from the status page until a later full refresh.



<details>
<summary>Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
-        if (0 === $pending || !empty($entries)) {
-            update_site_option('sd_ai_lang_packs_installed_translations', is_array($entries) ? $entries : []);
+        if (0 === $pending) {
+            update_site_option('sd_ai_lang_packs_installed_translations', is_array($entries) ? $entries : []);
+        } elseif (!empty($entries) && is_array($entries)) {
+            $existing = get_site_option('sd_ai_lang_packs_installed_translations', []);
+            $merged   = is_array($existing) ? $existing : [];
+
+            foreach ($entries as $entry) {
+                $key = ($entry['textdomain'] ?? $entry['slug'] ?? '') . '|' . ($entry['language'] ?? '');
+                if ('' !== $key) {
+                    $merged[$key] = $entry;
+                }
+            }
+
+            update_site_option('sd_ai_lang_packs_installed_translations', array_values($merged));
         }
```
